{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2020b.q19.material.recovered", "text": "材料：教师提问反射弧的定义，学生能够准确回答，教师继续提问：膝跳反射的神经中枢是什么？此时学生回答神经中枢是大脑和脊髓，教师继续追问：大脑和脊髓都是它的神经中枢吗？教师带领学生回忆初中内容，同时让学生画膝跳反射示意图。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f46c2e187714a4f6e2604a18bdaecb70fce79bbdb530b66890efe366d90df7b2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3174, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3283, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 19, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f46c2e187714a4f6e2604a18bdaecb70fce79bbdb530b66890efe366d90df7b2"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2020b.q19"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k06", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s4.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.manage", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.408.r001"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2020b.q19"], "word_count": 109, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f46c2e187714a4f6e2604a18bdaecb70fce79bbdb530b66890efe366d90df7b2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3174, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3283, "next_source_question_number": 29, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 19, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f46c2e187714a