{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2020b.q20.material.recovered", "text": "某版本高中生物学教材中，“生长素的发现过程”的部分内容如下：生长素的发现过程19世纪末，达尔文（C.Darwin，1809—1882）注意到了植物的向光性，并设计了实验探究其中的原因。实验发现，在受到单侧光照射时，金丝雀草的胚芽鞘会向光弯曲生长；如果去掉胚芽鞘的尖端或用锡箔纸把尖端罩上，则不发生弯曲；如果罩上尖端下面的一段，那么胚芽鞘还会弯向光源生长。达尔文根据实验提出：胚芽鞘尖端在单侧光刺激下，会向下面的伸长区传递某种“刺激”，使伸长区背光面比向光面生长快，使得胚芽鞘出现向光弯曲生长。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f46c2e187714a4f6e2604a18bdaecb70fce79bbdb530b66890efe366d90df7b2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3378, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3624, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "f46c2e187714a4f6e2604a18bdaecb70fce79bbdb530b66890efe366d90df7b2"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2020b.q20"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k07", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k10", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.408.r001", "ntce.outline.408.r018", "ntce.outline.408.r019", "ntce.outline.408.r020"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2020b.q20"], "word_count": 246, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2020年下半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "f46c2e187714a4f6e2604a18bdaecb70fce79bbdb530b66890efe366d90df7b2", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3378, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3624, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_